sequenceDiagram
  participant Caller
  participant PBX as SBC/PBX
  participant API as Telephony Adapter
  participant CRM
  participant Agent
  Caller->>PBX: Inbound call
  PBX->>API: Authenticated call event
  API->>CRM: Lookup caller
  CRM-->>API: Customer context
  API->>Agent: Route call and screen-pop
  Agent-->>API: Disposition
  API->>API: Persist call and outbox event
